  @Comments_38e8a140e5f4 = N'Claude 4.5 Sonnet standard tier pricing on Anthropic as of September 2025. Prompt caching available: write $3.75/M, read $0.30/M. Batch processing: 50% discount. Extended context (>200K tokens): $6/M input, $22.50/M output. WINDOW-CLOSED 2026-11-16: Anthropic retires `claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929` on the Claude API on November 30, 2026 (deprecated September 30, 2026; recommended replacement `claude-sonnet-5-5`). EndedAt is set to the retirement date so this price stops being selected automatically on 2026-12-01; Status stays Active until the date passes because the model is still served and billed at $3/$15 until then. The Anthropic Inference Provider route is already Deprecated. Follow-up for the run after the retirement date: flip that route to Inactive and this row to Expired per the routine''s deprecation recipe. Amazon Bedrock and OpenRouter set their own retirement schedules and are deliberately untouched. Source: https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations'
